  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pastoral Wells Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to construct two new pastoral wells in areas currently served by traditional wells and supply drinking water to an estimated 1;286 people and at least 9;471 animals . Inaddition; the project will provide women members training and tools to improve their production and marketing of traditional cheese products.</narrative>
  </description>
